    // =========================================================================
    // 1. The Conjecture (Formal Statement)
    // =========================================================================

    // CONJECTURE (Zamolodchikov 4D):
    //
    // There exists a 4-dimensional quantum field theory T_4D such that:
    //   (a) T_4D has E8 as a global symmetry (flavor or gauge)
